if you're too chicken to fight me, then you don't

00:19:36.320 --> 00:19:38.460
have to compete, but I'm going to tell everyone

00:19:38.460 --> 00:19:40.100
your secret. What?

00:19:40.460 --> 00:19:42.240
You'd do that? Yeah, sure.

00:19:42.600 --> 00:19:44.760
The truth is the truth, right? Your family

00:19:44.760 --> 00:19:47.060
can adapt to being in the limelight just like mine did.

00:19:47.180 --> 00:19:49.330
You wouldn't really. Just try

00:19:49.330 --> 00:19:51.410
me. Oh, okay then.

00:19:51.490 --> 00:19:54.160
I'll compete in the tournament. Cheer up!

00:19:54.280 --> 00:19:56.140
This is going to be a blast. You just

00:19:56.140 --> 00:19:58.120
wait and see. It's going to be way more fun

00:19:58.120 --> 00:19:59.940
than going out on some silly old date.

00:20:00.380 --> 00:20:04.000
That's for sure. Oh, and Gohan, there's one more condition.

00:20:04.620 --> 00:20:07.880
It's no big deal. I just want to learn how to fly, that's all.

00:20:08.080 --> 00:20:10.080
That shouldn't be too hard to teach me, should it?

00:20:10.520 --> 00:20:11.740
No, it's a cinch.

00:20:12.240 --> 00:20:15.280
Great. Well, we'll get started right away. Catch you later.

00:20:17.820 --> 00:20:19.960
Blackmailed again? How do I do it?

00:20:20.320 --> 00:20:24.660
It seems as though Gohan has gotten himself into a pickle once again.

00:20:25.020 --> 00:20:29.020
Stay tuned for scenes from the next episode of Dragon Ball Z.

00:20:34.030 --> 00:20:38.810
Surprise! That's right, folks, on the next episode of Dragon Ball Z.

00:20:38.950 --> 00:20:42.590
A few familiar faces return to the scene, and check it out.

00:20:42.710 --> 00:20:45.990
There's some hair-raising action on the way, Hollywood-style.

00:20:46.290 --> 00:20:47.850
Say cheese, everyone.

00:20:48.230 --> 00:20:51.770
Trouble? Looks like it, but nothing that a Super Saiyan can't handle.

00:20:51.970 --> 00:20:53.850
Is Goku really going to return to Earth?

00:20:53.990 --> 00:20:56.570
Find out next time on Dragon Ball Z.
